msgid "Note: Local circumstances for eclipses during thousands of years in the past and future are not reliable due to uncertainty in ΔT which is caused by fluctuations in Earth's rotation."
msgstr "Oharra: Ekipse milenioetan zehar sortzutako lokalen inguruko egoera ez da segurua, baita etorkizunean ere, ΔT ziurgabetasuna dela eta, Lurren biraketa aldakorten ondorioz."

msgid "Note: artificial satellites and unnamed stars are excluded from calculation"
msgstr "Oharra: Satelite artifizialak eta izena gabeko izarrak kalkuluetatik baztertuta daude"

msgid "Note: this tool doesn't apply the refraction correction for coordinates. Horizontal coordinates stop the clock, or the sky would turn away from the point while you arrive at it."
msgstr "Oharra: tresna honek ez du frakzio zuzenketa aplikatzen koordenatuetan. Koordenatu horizontalak ordua geldiarazten dute, edo zerua puntuarengatik aldatuko litzateke tokira iristen zarenean."

msgid "Notes: The quantity gamma is the minimum distance from the axis of lunar shadow cone to the center of Earth, in units of Earth’s equatorial radius. This distance is positive or negative, depending on whether the axis of the shadow cone passes north or south of the Earth's center. Path of solar eclipses during thousands of years in the past and future are not reliable due to uncertainty in ΔT which is caused by fluctuations in Earth's rotation."
msgstr "Oharrak: Gamma kantitatea Ilargiaren itzalaren konoaren ardatzaren eta Lurraren zentraren artean dagoen gutxieneko distantzia da, Lurraren ekuatorial-erradioaren unitatean. Distantzia hau positiboa edo negatiboa da, itzalaren konoaren ardatza Lurraren zentroan iparralde edo hegoaldean dagoen ala ez, kontuan hartuta. Eguzkiaren ekipse-eremua milenioetan zehar sortzutako lokalen inguruko egoera ez da segurua, baita etorkizunean ere, ΔT ziurgabetasuna dela eta, Lurren biraketa aldakorten ondorioz."

msgid "Notes: The quantity gamma is the minimum distance from the center of the Moon to the axis of Earth’s umbral shadow cone, in units of Earth’s equatorial radius. This distance is positive or negative, depending on whether the Moon passes north or south of the shadow cone axis. Local circumstances for eclipses during thousands of years in the past and future are not reliable due to uncertainty in ΔT which is caused by fluctuations in Earth's rotation."
msgstr "Oharrak: Gamma kantitatea Ilargiaren zentroan eta Lurren umbraren itzalaren konoaren ardatzaren artean dagoen gutxieneko distantzia da, Lurraren ekuatorial-erradioaren unitatean. Distantzia hau positiboa edo negatiboa da, Ilargia itzalaren konoaren ardatzaren iparralde edo hegoaldean pasatzen den ala ez, kontuan hartuta. Ekipse milenioetan zehar sortzutako lokalen inguruko egoera ez da segurua, baita etorkizunean ere, ΔT ziurgabetasuna dela eta, Lurren biraketa aldakorten ondorioz."

msgid "Notes: Time in parentheses means the contact is invisible at current location. Transit times during thousands of years in the past and future are not reliable due to uncertainty in ΔT which is caused by fluctuations in Earth's rotation."
msgstr "Oharrak: Parentesian agertzen den denbora kontakturik ez dela ikusten oraingoan kokalekuan esan nahi du. Trantsitu denborak milenioetan zehar sortzutako lokalen inguruko egoera ez dira segurua, baita etorkizunean ere, ΔT ziurgabetasuna dela eta, Lurren biraketa aldakorten ondorioz."

